# Production builds serve images and audio from CloudFront, in front of the
# private S3 bucket "konner-cabena-assets" (eu-west-2). Not a secret: it ends
# up in the page's HTML anyway. `npm run dev` ignores this file and serves
# assets from public/. Keep the bucket in step with `npm run assets:upload`.
